  "note": "Two columns: the left column is left-aligned at offset 51, the right column is centred and so its offset varies from 101 to 122; the split is taken at offset 95. Per rule 3, '2A-Serene Pease- Teacher' gives role_raw 'Teacher' and grade_or_dept '2A', while '1A-Michael Coutemanche', which prints no role word, gives role_raw '1A' and grade_or_dept 'First Grade Teachers'. On line 37 the two columns collide into one run of text -- 'Shayna LeBlanc-Parapropfessional Maggie Porpora- Occup.Therapy' -- and are recorded as two entries on that line, the first belonging to the left column and the second to the right. Lines 11, 26 and 45 each print two names separated by a slash and are recorded as two entries. Spellings are left as printed, including 'Parapropfessional' (line 37), 'Ist Grade' for what is almost certainly '1st Grade' (line 32), 'Carly Surrettte' (line 28), 'Deb Zivojinovie' (line 30) and 'Michael Coutemanche' (line 40); page 121 of the FY2018 report prints the last three as 'Carly Surette', 'Deb Zivojinovic' and 'Michael Courtemanche'."
